(text "FDD CONNECTORS\nJ: 34-pin IBM PC / Shugart. Odd pins GND. Pins 10/12/14/16 = MOTEA/DRVSB/DRVSA/MOTEB (PC)\n   resp. DS0/DS1/DS2/MOTOR (Shugart) - firmware selects bus type. Pin 34 = DSKCHG (PC) / READY (Shugart).\nJ: Amiga external drive, 2x12 header, pin n = DB23 pin n (Amiga HRM pinout), pin 24 GND.\n   Adapter cable to DB23. SEL1B shares DRVSEL_B, MTRXD shares MOTOR_B. Only one drive at a time.\n   CHECK: docs/Amiga_DB23_Adapter_Cable.md uses a different (inconsistent) pinout." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aa060855-d1b0-43f5-bb7a-f25a09e9625d"))
